WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.588
JAMIE: The efficiency is the point.

00:00:01.653 --> 00:00:03.657
ALEX: Oh. That actually connects.

00:00:03.722 --> 00:00:05.308
RUFUS: I was wondering when you'd get
there.

00:00:05.398 --> 00:00:07.357
RUFUS: I know. I'm delighted every time.

00:00:07.537 --> 00:00:11.018
JAMIE: The routing logic is the thing
I'd want to see opened up.

00:00:11.018 --> 00:00:14.499
JAMIE: Not necessarily open-source, but
some kind of explanation: here's what we
optimized

00:00:14.499 --> 00:00:17.980
JAMIE: for, here's how the decision was
made. Developers are generally more
comfortable

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:21.461
JAMIE: when they understand the tool.
